# Files and patterns excluded from the release zip.
#
# In the canonical Spec Kit extension layout, the repo root IS the extension
# root. Everything at the root that is NOT part of the extension's runtime
# surface must be listed here so it does not leak into the release zip.
#
# Glob patterns, one per line. Lines starting with # are comments. Patterns
# match paths relative to the repo root.
#
# Required files (kept regardless of this file):
#   extension.yml, README.md, LICENSE, CHANGELOG.md,
#   commands/**, templates/**, scripts/{bash,powershell}/**

# This file itself is build metadata, not part of the installed extension.
.extensionignore

# Spec Kit design artifacts and dogfood install (not extension content).
specs/
.specify/

# CI configuration and pipeline scripts.
.github/

# Repo metadata that does not belong in an installed extension.
catalog.json
CONTRIBUTING.md
CHANGELOG.md
CLAUDE.md
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.markdownlint.yaml
.markdownlint.yml
.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc
.claude/

# Build output.
dist/

# VCS and editor metadata.
.git/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

# OS metadata.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Scratch and temp.
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log

# Dependency caches.
node_modules/
